VALUES ('published', 'STARTED BY US · 2023', 'IRESS, the Italian Rocket Engineering Student Summit', 'In May 2023 we brought rocket teams from Italy''s main universities together for the first time, in the Aula Magna of Politecnico di Torino, with speakers from ArianeSpace and Avio. The summit now moves city every year: Padova in 2024, Rome in 2025.', 'In May 2023 we brought rocket teams from Italy''s main universities together for the first time, in the Aula Magna of Politecnico di Torino. The summit now moves city every year.', '/outreach/iress-2023-torino.webp', 'Students from Italy''s rocket teams in the Aula Magna of Politecnico di Torino, under the IRESS screen.', '[{"year":2023,"place":"Torino"},{"year":2024,"place":"Padova"},{"year":2025,"place":"Rome"}]'::jsonb);
